+/*
+ * vayu (SM8150, WCN3998): the same blocks, other addresses (YAAP kernel sm8150.dtsi, xiaomi
+ * base sm8150.dtsi), and the firmware of vayu's NON-HLOS (tools/fwtable.py). The modem
